The $K$ smallest elements are $S[0], \dots, S[K-1]$.
The $K$ largest elements are $S[M-K], \dots, S[M-1]$.
We need to pair them up. To maximize the chance of satisfying the condition, we should pair the smallest top with the largest bottom, the second smallest top with the second largest bottom, and so on.
